{"parse": {"title": "7TH-22", "pageid": 55159, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-21.5\" title=\"7TH-21.5\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-22</span><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-23\" title=\"7TH-23\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">22</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.87.B4.E4.BC.A0.E9.81.93.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"致传道者\">致传道者</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 致传道者</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Ones Who Pray</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>认<span class=\"color-value\"></span>识<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>真<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>美<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>善<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>解<span class=\"color-value\"></span>除<span class=\"color-value\"></span>沉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>沦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>仇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>恨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>恶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10722</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这平坦的沙滩上，<br />在这海面与陆地之间，<br />我能建造或创作什么，<br />以抵挡暗夜的降临？<br /><br />告诉我，该刻下何种符咒，<br />以抵御袭来的波涛，<br />告诉我，该建筑何样堡垒，<br />以庇护比我更长久的岁月。<br /><br />               ——阿尔弗雷德·豪斯曼</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-510610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-510610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-510610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>把这个喝了，能让你忘掉腿部的疼痛……对，这酒并不是用我头上的葡萄酿造的，你大可放心。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_hongzha.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战火已经停息，此地却永久地留下了创伤的烙印。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>真理的殿堂已经是一地废墟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210观察了一会儿伤员的情形，确定他的痛苦已经得以缓解。而后，他站起来，望向刚刚进入厅堂的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>29，再坚持一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>888背着丧失了行动能力的同胞，小心地让他在尚算开阔的平地上躺下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的胳膊也在炮火轰炸中挂彩，所幸伤势并不致命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自整数们醒来后，便一直在重复这样的过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>还有尚未发现的伤员吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>不，我走遍了整座岛屿，所有数字应当都在这里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>是吗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声轻微的叹息，关于一个无可奈何的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——所以，其他人都加入了重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厅堂沉默着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仅在数小时前，人们还在这里争辩、议论、进行思想的交锋和学派事务的探讨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如今，厅堂空了一半。被炸成碎石的穹顶自高处落下，占据了缺席者的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>玛尔塔女士，6仍未醒来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盲眼的信众摇了摇头，脸上的忧虑越发凝重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女妖不再言语，她身上的伤口也急需清理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接连发生的变故摧毁了这里的一切：信仰的崩溃、人类的轰炸、重塑之手的离间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好在，它们已经全都离开了——真理、仇敌、同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仅剩下往昔的碎片和伤员的低吟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这空旷的寂静之中，有人开始微弱的祈祷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>……唯一的无限，唯一的自在者，伟大的不可言喻者。请允许我的祈求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>让我不要丧失于本性的灵光，让真理指引魂灵以自由……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哀悼与希冀由同一个声音说出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个庄严的时刻，它予以生者沉思的空间，也予以逝者片刻的尊重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也让人们从悲伤和悔恨中短暂地移开目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>请赐予我启明的力量，让我得以冲破盲目与无知之网。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低声的跟读加入了祈祷，和声循环往复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>……由此，得以解除萦绕在我身上的沉沦、仇恨和恶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>得以冲破罪恶的根源、堕落的镣铐、阴郁的高墙、逼真的死亡、感觉的尸首、包围我们的坟墓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>认识到真理的美和善，领悟到万物的平衡和限度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅳ：</div><div>——够了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人突然发出了呵斥。是29，协理人刚刚放下的伤员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的腿被炸断了，但依然强忍着痛苦，背靠石柱，使自己能够坐起来一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅳ：</div><div>事到如今，祈祷又有什么用？！真理已经不存在了！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅳ：</div><div>我们向谁祈祷？又有谁会回应？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怒吼没能持续，男人的声音逐渐哽咽，化为不甘的啜泣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅳ：</div><div>我们在漫长时光里所追求的一切……究竟有什么意义？我们这些侥幸存活的人……又是为了什么而活下来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——不，真理还存在着！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>清亮的答音。像一粒石子落在冬日冰冻的湖面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37气喘吁吁地出现在厅堂内，旁边站着司辰小队的成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我通过了无限定者的试炼，我拿到了它，这个一劳永逸免于生之巨轮流转的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>只要给我一些时间解开——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厅堂的所有人都转向了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尚在祈祷的人、缺失了腿脚的人、丢失了魂灵和信仰的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>协理人迎了上来，她的声音依然沉静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>我们会全力协助你，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>问题是，你需要多少时间……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一针见血的疑问，女孩移开了双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上次回答这个问题时的失败，令她丧失了脱口而出的信心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……关于这一点，我想，有一个办法可以提高破译密码的速度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，在世界的另一个角落，正有人在雨幕之下做着同样的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>免疫“暴雨”的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但在获得他们的帮助前，我需要征求你的同意，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抬起帽檐，礼貌地注视她的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这事关学派的原则，理应严肃地对待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——你愿意我将你得到的真理分享出去吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>关于术式副作用的研究正紧锣密鼓地进行着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出现的诅咒种类在纸上蜿蜒如一条无首的长蛇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，它的确是完全随机的。在目前的统计样本里，有0.52%的概率不会触发任何副作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而在登记的81种副作用中，39种会对生物躯体造成不可逆转的破坏作用，24种会永久改变躯体存在的性质……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>还有18种较为轻微，仅在体表造成轻微损害，不会影响施术者正常生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>科算中心储备的术式库可以有效防御最后一种情况，但前两类诅咒依然是几乎致死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是张用生命写成的统计表，她也的确同拆解机器般去推演它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>实验进行72次后，副作用多样性明显减少。但不确定这是因为在同一对象上实验次数过多，还是因为副作用的类型有极限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……而这些副作用90%以上，都和“泥土”、“尘埃”有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它和这个术式的力量来源有关吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拿着列表的手短暂地顿了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这里登记的副作用共有86种，不是81种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……这5条是我什么时候写上去的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敲门声中断了她的思绪，助理礼貌地走了进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>露西女士，芝诺军备学院的计划成功了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>他们联合司辰小队，将重塑之手的领袖传送到了一处废弃的军事基地上，随后关闭传送阵，朝那里发射了一枚燃料空气弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……炸弹击中了目标，生命反应切实消失了，观察室的摄像头记录下了那历史性的一幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人在纸张和文件间点了点头。<br />这是个震撼人心的好消息，但在研究的紧要关头，她分不出太多回路去表现喜悦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是十分伟大的荣耀，请替我向上将传达祝贺之词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>另外，有两个人想要和您通话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>一位是司辰，在对重塑之手的作战成功后，她立刻向科算中心提出了通话请求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>她希望我们能远程协助阿派朗学派的成员解开一串数字密码，这事关免疫“暴雨”的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个不可忽视的情报，总负责人迅速地抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请立刻帮我接通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助理点了点头，但绷紧的肩膀并未松懈。显然，她此行并不只为了传递好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……另一个人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>是帮助马库斯调查员传回这个术式的维也纳神秘学家，卡卡尼亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助理的眼神有一些犹豫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……我们已将目前研究的进度和副作用告知于她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>但她仍然希望获得术式的正确读法。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-22"}}